{% About
  title="Why do we bring colour to our partner clubs?"
  subtitle="Our mission is to inspire and nurture our sports community – by helping coaches grow professionally and giving all athletes the chance to enjoy it."
  content="<br/><br/><span class=\"text-neutral-400\">With more than 20 years of top-level sports experience across our team, we have been fortunate to learn from the knowledge and inspiration of great coaches in football, handball, hockey, swimming, and many other sports. Thanks to that experience, we understand today's challenges for coaches better and better – from performance pressure to building engagement and team spirit.</span> <br> We believe in a sports climate where fun is the driving force behind personal and collective growth. By giving athletes, volunteers and board members an environment where they feel safe, valued and inspired to get the best out of themselves and their club."
/%}

